%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e32d70991a71c9649876788061c5a6cd, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chapter 0 - 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  hasChapterIntro: 1
  chapterNumber: Chapter 0 - 4
  chapterName: "\u2018One thing after another.\u2019"
  hasBattleScene: 0
  battleSceneName: 
  loadMap: 1
  sentences:
  - text: "Well\u2026 that wasn\u2019t so bad, actually."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -6220859904223034604, guid: 45b4fc3fbd6830b4c8b48bb341d3352b, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: You will suffice.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: 7583987884068822478, guid: 1c0c927b75d008546aa7cb87a3af1664, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: I withheld some information before I could truly gauge how fit you are
      for the responsibility of a Caretaker.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: 7583987884068822478, guid: 1c0c927b75d008546aa7cb87a3af1664, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "In addition to maintaining the peace in the Garden, you are also to tend
      to the \u2018guests\u2019 that we host here."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: 7583987884068822478, guid: 1c0c927b75d008546aa7cb87a3af1664, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: Guests?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: Outsiders invited by the will of the Garden. Invitations come in the form
      of a scroll that the Garden manifests outside of the Garden, usually in vicinity
      of the planned guest. In most cases, already on their person, in a place of
      interest, or on a body that they are already looting.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: Okay, but what do you mean by hosting them? Do I have to learn tea ceremonies
      as well?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "Rest assured, it\u2019s not that kind of hosting. Guests invited to the
      Garden are often people that seek to reap the rewards that the invitation promises
      them.  Our duty as Caretakers is to act as hosts, this means introducing the
      house rules of the Garden and reading them their rights, confirming their intentions,
      and then proceeding with their Trial."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "And\u2026 I\u2019m assuming based off of the vibe this place gives, this
      \u2018Trial\u2019 is some sort of challenge that the Guests are supposed to
      overcome?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "More or less. Guests can seek out something in reward for participating
      in the Garden\u2019s Trials, and our role in these Trials is to serve as the
      trial itself."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "So we\u2019re essentially kidnapping people and then beating them up for
      fun, and if they win, they get something cool to bring home."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -4777918531010614747, guid: 34ee96cfd07cb8446ae90d1d480e3754, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: Not quite.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "The Garden\u2019s Trials isn\u2019t just some form of twisted entertainment.
      In the face of life and death, our emotions can vary very wildly. It is in
      this timing where the essence of memories are the most volatile, and which,
      as you may have guessed, is where the Garden will benefit from these Trials."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "Serving as the trial, you will deal with these guests in combat. The guests
      who overcome their trial will be deemed worthy to earn their reward. Granted,
      there is the possibility that you may perish in the process of these trials,
      but it\u2019s only temporary. You\u2019ll get back up when the Trial closes."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 4114157388386300877, guid: 5aa8130d623ac8149ae0912a814ac8e6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "Though\u2026 I will also clarify something about the Garden\u2019s Trials.
      Combat against the Caretakers is not the only trial that these guests can face,
      it is just the fastest and simplest route that the guests can take to their
      reward."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: Should the guests request for something more specific and intimate, something
      more deeper than mere riches and power, then it is our duty as Caretaker to
      guide them through their Personal Trial granted by the Garden. Whatever we
      may encounter in these Personal Trials is highly variable, be prepared to expect
      anything.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "\u2026I think I get the gist of it now. So, how do these invitations actually
      work anyway?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -4777918531010614747, guid: 34ee96cfd07cb8446ae90d1d480e3754, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: Open up the invitation and register the scrolls you wish to send out to
      these guests.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: 
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: The scrolls will naturally be sent to those in need of the rewards.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "\u2026Huh, sounds easy enough."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: -6220859904223034604, guid: 45b4fc3fbd6830b4c8b48bb341d3352b, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: Like I said, you need not be worried. The will of the Garden acts as a
      compass for the invitations, which allows for the scrolls to be manifested
      in the vicinity of the guests.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 7583987884068822478, guid: 1c0c927b75d008546aa7cb87a3af1664, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: Ah~ Makes things a lot clearer now.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: -6220859904223034604, guid: 45b4fc3fbd6830b4c8b48bb341d3352b, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: While you send out these invitations, some invitations may turn red.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 7583987884068822478, guid: 1c0c927b75d008546aa7cb87a3af1664, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "A red invitation indicates that it can be sent to special guests that
      the Garden deems to be desired. Until we register the scrolls that match what
      the red invitation requires, our \u2018story\u2019 will be halted for a bit."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 7583987884068822478, guid: 1c0c927b75d008546aa7cb87a3af1664, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "Well, that\u2019s just a bit weird how that works. There\u2019s no guarantee
      that the guest will always respond to the invitation, no?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: 1606658783463881559, guid: 40727bcd591a05448acb2f6861bb4f08, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "Quite the contrary. In fact, they\u2019re destined to come. And the guests
      will accept the invitation of their own will and enter the Garden."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: -1787240519333269993, guid: f2a495eec40429f46add8d4fb61e5091, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 3656839501610869304, guid: 2b31f755715f9ab4488e2118816696c6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: "Destined, huh? That\u2019s surprisingly polite and fair. Most of the time,
      people\u2019s lives are taken away by others without any consent."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4444d0eef7e7c2044a7431024e07105a, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: -4777918531010614747, guid: 34ee96cfd07cb8446ae90d1d480e3754, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: -5857114442203394712, guid: a5d7d45117a6bc2438c991599d5a350c, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  - text: The Garden is a place of limitless possibilities. Even for as long as I
      have been here, I have yet to fathom the infinite space and power this Garden
      has. As far as I understand, the Garden seeks to harvest memories in its purest
      essence. Apparently, forcing the guest in against their will causes distress
      in a way that decays the essence of their memories.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9551ecb160c9ae0458976bafb3aae211, type: 2}
    jobTitle: Head Caretaker
    characterSprite: {fileID: -5206761803832305590, guid: 8ea384a28134a4640a5836ccbd70faaf, type: 3}
    characterPos: 0
    characterSprite2: {fileID: 4114157388386300877, guid: 5aa8130d623ac8149ae0912a814ac8e6, type: 3}
    characterPos2: 2
    characterSprite3: {fileID: 0}
    characterPos3: 0
  backgroud: {fileID: -6699059474145905575, guid: ceb05e304a908d24885c8d4d52b326dd, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c179a81fec32af243a0a15ed6b9685ec, type: 2}
